[SPEAKER_02]: contact lines which are very processed very hard lines which are processed very soft if they get if they caught something like a velcro

02:21:33.383 --> 02:21:46.075
[SPEAKER_00]: tape or something you're wrong or not so treat it as your baby fair enough duly noted and i'm super surprised nobody talks about this these things

