[SPEAKER_00]: twice with the same shoot the fabric can't handle it or lines can't handle it or can anything whatever happens anything okay connections

02:28:22.274 --> 02:28:30.593
[SPEAKER_00]: variables again yeah Interesting, man. Scary. This was coming from more or less like in a cloud suck perspective, I think, where you have

